+// Excludes compute (stage 5: dispatch() resets g_c0_dim_buf=nil and updates g_dispatch_dim
+// in c0+0x200), writable storage/image bindings (must note GPU writes), geometry/gmem
+// bindings, stale UBO-embedded handles after in-place buffer mutation (mem_gen), and
